{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32860","headline":"府试观兰亭图 · 李频","name":"府试观兰亭图","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往会人何处，遗踪事可观。\n林亭今日在，草木古春残。\n笔想吟中驻，杯疑饮後乾。\n向青穿峻岭，当白认回湍。\n月影窗间夜，湖光枕上寒。\n不知诗酒客，谁更慕前欢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32860.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32860","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}